Smith</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Fournier</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The RNA world of the nucleolus: two major families of small RNAs defined by different box elements with related functions</article-title><source>Cell</source><year>1996</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>823</fpage><lpage>834</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8797828</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B17"><label>17</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cavaille</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Nicoloso</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bachellerie</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Targeted ribose methylation of RNA <italic>in vivo</italic> directed by tailored antisense RNA guides</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>1996</year><volume>383</volume><fpage>732</fpage><lpage>735</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8878486</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B18"><label>18</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kiss-Laszlo</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Henry</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Bachellerie</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Caizergues-Ferrer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kiss</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Site-specific ribose methylation of preribosomal RNA: a novel function for small nucleolar RNAs</article-title><source>Cell</source><year>1996</year><volume>85</volume><fpage>1077</fpage><lpage>1088</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8674114</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B19"><label>19</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tollervey</surn